OL,3,ATennessee governor rejects clemency bid
OL,4,Afor Christa Pike as execution looms
OL,5,
OL,6,FTennessee Governor Bill Lee has denied
OL,7,Fa clemency request from death row
OL,8,Finmate Christa Pike, who is scheduled
OL,9,Fto be executed by lethal injection on
OL,10,FWednesday.
OL,12,FPike, now 50, was 18 when she and her
OL,13,Fthen-boyfriend beat, tortured and
OL,14,Fmurdered Colleen Slemmer, a 19-year-old
OL,15,Fthey met at a job training camp for
OL,16,Ftroubled teens.
OL,18,FShe may have one last chance at halting
OL,19,Fher execution as her attorneys have
OL,20,Ffiled a petition with the US Supreme
OL,21,FCourt hoping for a last-minute
OL,22,Freprieve.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
