OL,3,ATennessee governor rejects clemency bid
OL,4,Afor Christa Pike as execution looms
OL,5,
OL,6,FIf it proceeds, Pike would be the first
OL,7,Fwoman to be executed in Tennessee in
OL,8,Fmore than 200 years. Only 18 women have
OL,9,Fbeen executed in the US since the
OL,10,F1970s, compared to 1,663 men.
